## About this package

This package is part of the ${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_MAJOR}.${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_MINOR}.${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_PATCH} release of Emgu LiteRT. It contains:

- `Emgu.LiteRT.Tflite.dll`: the Interpreter API (`Emgu.TF.Lite` namespace), wrapping TensorFlow Lite through the `tfliteextern` native library.
- `Emgu.LiteRT.dll`: the CompiledModel API (`Emgu.LiteRT` namespace), calling LiteRT's own runtime library (`libLiteRt`) directly.
- `Emgu.LiteRT.Util.dll`: shared utilities (`Emgu.LiteRT.Util` namespace) used by both.

For online documentation please visit
<${NUGET_EMGU_URL}/wiki/files/emgutf/${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_MAJOR}.${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_MINOR}.${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_PATCH}/document-lite/index.html>

Release note can be found at
<${NUGET_EMGU_URL}/wiki/index.php/Emgu_TF_Version_History#Emgu.TF-${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_MAJOR}.${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_MINOR}.${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_PATCH}>

## Note

To deploy Emgu LiteRT to a specific platform, you will also need to add one of the ${EMGUTF_LITE_NUGET_ID}.runtime.{platform} nuget packages to your executable project. Currently only ${EMGUTF_LITE_NUGET_ID}.runtime.macos includes `libLiteRt` for the `Emgu.LiteRT` API; the other runtime packages only include `tfliteextern` for the `Emgu.TF.Lite` API. Use the following link to search for the ${EMGUTF_LITE_NUGET_ID}.runtime nuget packages:
<https://www.nuget.org/packages?q=${EMGUTF_LITE_NUGET_ID}.runtime>
